OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny spells. A mainly dry
OL,7,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,12,Fclear spells and a few showers mainly
OL,13,Fin the west. Overnight some more
OL,14,Ffrequent showers spreading to Moray. A
OL,15,Fwindy night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FCloudy with showers or longer
OL,18,Fspells of rain, some heavy. Showers
OL,19,Fwill ease later in the day. Windy at
OL,20,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
